.Dd $Mdocdate: October 27 2026 $
.Dt FUGUVM 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm fuguvm
.Nd install and manage OpenBSD virtual machines
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm fuguvm
.Op Fl hqv
.Op Fl Fl emulate
.Op Fl Fl project Ar dir
.Op Fl Fl vm Ar name
.Ar command
.Op Ar argument ...
.Nm fuguvm
.Cm init
.Op Ar dir
.Nm fuguvm
.Cm up
.Op Fl Fl no-cache
.Nm fuguvm
.Cm down | destroy | start
.Nm fuguvm
.Cm stop
.Op Fl f
.Nm fuguvm
.Cm status
.Op Ar key
.Nm fuguvm
.Cm wait
.Op Fl Fl timeout Ar seconds
.Nm fuguvm
.Cm ssh
.Op Fl Fl
.Op Ar command Op Ar argument ...
.Nm fuguvm
.Cm put
.Op Fl Fl mode Ar octal
.Ar local remote
.Nm fuguvm
.Cm get Ar remote local
.Nm fuguvm
.Cm console
.Nm fuguvm
.Cm expect Ar script
.Op Ar argument ...
.Nm fuguvm
.Cm cache list
.Nm fuguvm
.Cm cache clear
.Op Fl Fl stale
.Nm fuguvm
